# --- Not redistributable -------------------------------------------------
# Adapter evaluation artefacts from a deployed assistant. Aggregate scores
# only were ever read, and even those are not published: the findings that
# depend on them report NO DATA on a public checkout by design. Point
# ADAPTER_EVAL_ROOT at a deployment's own artefacts to reproduce them.
adapter-eval/
